This error occurs during aggregation-group creation.

The current source includes a group-creation path that passes `hubId || ''` into the Supabase creation function.

Investigate this behavior carefully.

An empty string is not a valid substitute for a real hub identifier, and it is not equivalent to SQL `NULL`.

However, confirm the actual schema and database function before deciding on the complete fix.

